        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "An investment account was opened with an initial value of \\$890. The value of the account\ndoubled every 10 years. Which equation represents the value of the account $M(t)$, in dollars, $t$\nyears after the account was opened？"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "kind": "editable-pdf-source",
        "sourceSetId": "pdf-373082a351ff4618bb63a9b8a0ede3a9",
